# Figma rules

- Extract design tokens (colors, spacing, typography) from Figma before implementing; use tokens in code, not raw values from the design.
- Map Figma components/frames to React/Astro components with consistent naming; sanitize layer names (PascalCase for components, kebab-case for CSS).
- Use Figma auto-layout semantics when implementing: flex/grid with gap for spacing; preserve direction and alignment.
- Document intentional deviations from design; when specs are ambiguous, use design-system conventions and note assumptions.
- Keep token definitions in sync with Figma styles when design is the source of truth; update tokens before components when designs change.
- Use Figma MCP when available for direct token extraction and component inspection; fall back to manual export when MCP is unavailable.
